问题:
- 当从小窗启动一个已经在前台全屏运行的应用时,activityStarting() 会将其强制转换为小窗
- 原因是 launchForeground.get() 在普通场景下为 null,导致 keepNativeForeground() 检查失效

修复:
- 在 launchForeground 为 null 时,实时获取当前前台应用状态
- 检查目标任务是否已经是全屏前台应用(mode=1, !owned)
- 如果是,保留其全屏状态,不转换为小窗
- 添加日志记录保留全屏的决策

影响范围:
- WindowEngine.activityStarting() 方法
- 不影响分享窗口、快捷方式等已设置 launchForeground 的场景
---
 .../floatingwindow/legacy/WindowEngine.java        | 14 ++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/dev/local/sunwindowdemo/features/floatingwindow/legacy/WindowEngine.java b/app/src/main/java/dev/local/sunwindowdemo/features/floatingwindow/legacy/WindowEngine.java
index 2b8ca42..087c5a3 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/dev/local/sunwindowdemo/features/floatingwindow/legacy/WindowEngine.java
+++ b/app/src/main/java/dev/local/sunwindowdemo/features/floatingwindow/legacy/WindowEngine.java
@@ -898,8 +898,18 @@ final class WindowEngine {
             if((Integer)a.field(target,"mUserId")!=s.userId||a.call(target,"getDisplayContent")!=a.call(s.task,"getDisplayContent"))return null;
             ComponentName component=(ComponentName)a.field(target,"realActivity");
             if(component==null||!Wire.allowedPackage(component.getPackageName())||Wire.PKG.equals(component.getPackageName()))return null;
-            if(keepNativeForeground(launchForeground.get(),target,(String)a.field(requestActivity,"packageName"),
-                (Integer)a.field(target,"mUserId"),a.call(target,"getDisplayContent")))return null;
+            // Check if the target is already a native fullscreen foreground app that should be preserved.
+            // If launchForeground was not set, capture the current state to avoid converting an existing fullscreen app.
+            NativeForeground foreground=launchForeground.get();
+            if(foreground==null){
+                try{foreground=nativeForeground();}
+                catch(Exception error){log.accept("FOREGROUND_SNAPSHOT_FAILED "+FrameworkAccess.reason(error));}
+            }
+            if(keepNativeForeground(foreground,target,(String)a.field(requestActivity,"packageName"),
+                (Integer)a.field(target,"mUserId"),a.call(target,"getDisplayContent"))){
+                log.accept("KEEP_NATIVE_FULLSCREEN taskId="+a.field(target,"mTaskId")+" pkg="+component.getPackageName());
+                return null;
+            }
             Session next=sessionFor(target);
             boolean fresh=next==null;
             if(fresh){
